WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:05.290
The Nebula is being prepped to have
its outer armor completely replaced.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.290
All hands, please undergo procedures
in accordance with Service Manual 203.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:10.500
Say, Hakobe...

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Rest easy. It ain't as bad as it looks.
Say, Hakobe...

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:19.660
Yes. We're replacing the entire exterior,
but there isn't much damage to the frame.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.290
Still...

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.540
Still?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.040
It's about Makoto's response values, right?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.700
Yes. It probably means...

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.500
Yeah, all done. At the last depot...

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.700
Nebula.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.540
There are no outstanding changes
to your vitals or other items.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.620
Of course.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.370
Just in case, we need
to run a detailed exam.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.910
Not necessary. I'm fine.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.200
It can't be.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.290
It can't be.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.410
It can't be!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.790
It can't be...

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.790
I've heard the S.O.S.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:19.750
Have you finally heard it?

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.700
In a cutesy way

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.250
Impure or pure, which character?

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.080
Maybe they're the same

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.620
The love beat is opened up full throttle

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:49.620
I've noticed, this is a special mission... I've got it

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:56.040
I'll show you for real, because I'll make it come true

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:59.910
In a world that's pierced through the skies

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:06.870
I felt a strange emotion, I liked you in an instant!

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.910
I'm sure I'll win with a smile

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:15.250
Sure enough a smile is the right way

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:20.830
I was small and crying but I'll rise to the challenge

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.160
I wonder what this palpitation is

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.500
I need a little medical attention

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:34.540
This feeling of slight fever
could be your fault, S.O.S!

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:47.790
Room No. 501

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.370
Thanks for the hard work.
You really came through this time.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.330
For me and Epi,
this kinda thing was WAY easy!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.120
Anyway, c'mon, gimme more candy!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.290
All right.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.540
Today you can have as much as you want.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.580
All right!

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.870
With this, testing of the
Epimetheus is concluded.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.160
And now that we've finally
found the last iDOL...

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.250
Soon, we shall assemble the actors.
The time for the curtains to rise draws near.

