the setting sun together.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.330
Makoto?

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.660
I... I'm not wrong.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:37.330
I've piloted all alone this whole time.
Seven years.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.040
I've made the Nebula move without fail.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.290
Yes. That's ri-

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.620
THAT again?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.080
Stop it with the perfunctory
answers already.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.830
Over and over, all I get is vague replies.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.580
I'm sorry.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.910
Don't apologize!

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:06.250
Sis... It's strange.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.160
To have the iDOLs do what they want
with us, body and mind,

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.080
getting us beaten up in the process...

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:22.200
I said I'd never end up like you. And yet...!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.080
It's like I'M the one who's wrong!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.370
That's what you thought?

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.120
Of course!

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:35.500
I've thought so as long
as I've piloted the Nebula.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.040
Why don't you ever praise me?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:43.580
Why don't you recognize what I do?
Why? Why?!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.160
Makoto.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.700
No! Stop it!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.830
Makoto.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.040
