00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:55.040
You're shaking. You've been so anxious.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.660
Sis!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.790
I'm sorry. I thought you understood.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.410
I mean... I mean...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.910
Sis, no matter how well I piloted the iDOL,
you never praised me!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:15.330
All you ever looked at was the iDOLs!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.700
You brought Minase and Amami in
without telling me anything...

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.160
I have to just shut up and
do what Futami says.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:29.250
I've done everything I was supposed to...
in your place. And yet...!

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.250
It's all right.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.830
I know more than anyone how you feel.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.950
I know.

