00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.160
Yeah. What is it?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.410
I want to talk to you about something.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:20.500
About your future... Yours and the Nebula's.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.910
Oh. It's been decided?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:33.750
Can you come in?
I want to talk to you in person.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.660
Okay. Understood.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.250
All right. See you later.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.200
Yeah.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.040
Oh, hello?

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.750
I'm sorry.

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:14.540
Makoto Kikuchi.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:15.660
Ma'am.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:20.200
I shall now tell you how
you will be dealt with.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:27.950
"Makoto Kikuchi, lead Idolmaster
of Prometheus 2, the Nebula...

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:33.870
"is hereby relieved of her rights
as an Idolmaster."

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.160
For now, we're trading out
the Nebula's Idolmaster

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.120
and preparing for the next conflict.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.040
Rather lax, wouldn't you say?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.500
They're sure to send the Hiems
into battle against us.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.750
Epimetheus is operational as well.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.830
Once the Mischling are complete,
it will be too late.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.200
Sir.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.620
Well? How'd it go after that?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.540
She never came back to the house.
She probably never will.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:50.750
Well, that's good, isn't it? That's less of
a bother you'll have to deal with.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.500
You're right.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:56.700
There's a nice face.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.200
No way!

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.750
Makoto is...

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.750
Yes. She quit Mondenkind.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.830
It can't be! I mean...

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:17.950
This was her decision.
Try to understand, Haruka.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.660
It's begun, hasn't it?
In more ways than one...

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.540
Enter.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.290
Welcome.

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.450
To Turiavita.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:05.200
Like a saint that crosses the ages

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:14.200
In what kind of loneliness did you cry?

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:23.080
Stretching out to a star so far away

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:31.620
Say, I'll depict my feelings, look up at the sky

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:43.080
Dear boy, if I always look for you in my heart

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:52.040
Ah, I'll release a light so strong it will envelop you

00:22:52.040 --> 00:23:01.000
That sparkling trail will be the guide for us both

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:12.580
Now, no matter where we look, we feel the truth

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:40.950
Preview
Hard to Move,
Somehow

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:29.080
This is Hotaru. I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.370
I'd planned on going as far as I could, but...

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:35.830
No, that's enough about husbands.
Anyway, I'm sorry.

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:38.120
I'll call again once I have
my emotions under control.

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.160
This has been Hotaru Yasuhara.
